---
title: "AD-03 Scheduler: Advance Run after a Job Finishes (UML Activity Diagram)"
---
flowchart TB
  start((●)) --> a1[FinishJob: store result, invalidate job token]
  a1 --> d0{Failed and retries left?}
  d0 -- yes --> rq[Set job queued, attempt + 1] --> wake
  d0 -- no --> a2[Begin transaction]
  a2 --> a3[Find waiting jobs in this run]
  a3 --> loop[Take next waiting job]
  loop --> d1{All needs finished?}
  d1 -- no --> nxt
  d1 -- yes --> d2{Condition true?<br/>on_success / on_failure / always}
  d2 -- yes --> q[Set queued]
  d2 -- no --> s[Set skipped]
  s --> chg[Mark 'changed']
  q --> chg
  chg --> nxt{More waiting jobs?}
  nxt -- yes --> loop
  nxt -- no --> d3{Anything changed this pass?}
  d3 -- yes --> a3
  d3 -- no --> a4[Recompute run status]
  a4 --> a5[Commit transaction]
  a5 --> a6[Publish ci.job.* / ci.run.finished events]
  a6 --> wake[Wake runners for newly queued labels]
  wake --> stop((◉))
